# S Performance — limits (honest)

- Default engine is an **interpreter** on Python host.
- SVM is a bytecode path for many constructs; not full native speed.
- Suitable for: scripts, tools, learning, small apps, sealed packs.
- Not suitable yet for: heavy CPU loops, games at 60fps, large server load without host optimization.
- Recursion depth is capped (interpreter MAX_RECURSION).
- HTTP calls are blocking with timeout.
- Prefer algorithms O(n log n) or better on large lists; no magic.

Measure with your workloads before promising latency.
